@startuml diagrama-secuencia
title TP1 — Inicio y recorrido de una orden

actor Main
participant StartGate
participant AssignmentWorker as AW
participant ValidationWorker as VW
participant PrintingWorker as PW
participant QualityControlWorker as QW
participant PrinterPool as PP
participant EventLog as EL
participant TerminationTracker as TT

== Inicio conjunto ==
Main -> AW : start()
Main -> VW : start()
Main -> PW : start()
Main -> QW : start()
AW -> StartGate : awaitOpen()
VW -> StartGate : awaitOpen()
PW -> StartGate : awaitOpen()
QW -> StartGate : awaitOpen()
Main -> StartGate : openWhenAllWorkersAreReady()
StartGate --> AW : notifyAll()
StartGate --> VW : notifyAll()
StartGate --> PW : notifyAll()
StartGate --> QW : notifyAll()

== Recorrido ==
AW -> PP : reserveFor(orderId)
AW -> EL : CREATED → WAITING_VALIDATION
AW -> VW : offer(order)
VW -> EL : WAITING_VALIDATION → READY_TO_PRINT
VW -> PW : offer(order)
PW -> EL : READY_TO_PRINT → PRINTED
PW -> PP : release(printer)
PW -> QW : offer(order)
QW -> EL : PRINTED → APPROVED / DEFECTIVE
QW -> TT : orderCompleted()

== Salidas anticipadas ==
note over VW, TT
Modelo inválido: VW libera impresora,
registra REJECTED y completa la orden.
end note
note over PW, TT
Impresión fallida: PW inhabilita impresora,
registra PRINT_FAILED y completa la orden.
end note

@enduml
